OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain will clear southeast
OL,6,FEngland by early afternoon. Otherwise,
OL,7,Fsunny spells are expected, although
OL,8,Fshowers will feed in across the UK,
OL,9,Fmost frequent in the northwest.
OL,10,FFeeling cool in a north to
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly wind.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny inland showers will
OL,14,Fmostly fade, although some may
OL,15,Fcontinue to affect North Sea and Irish
OL,16,FSea coasts. Otherwise dry with clear
OL,17,Fskies. Chilly, with a rural frost
OL,18,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
