OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry with sunny spells
OL,6,Fon Saturday. Showers are likely near
OL,7,Fsome eastern coasts. Temperatures
OL,8,Faround average by day, but with a risk
OL,9,Fof an overnight frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
